#: ksecretd/knewwalletdialog.cpp:176
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"No suitable GPG encryption keys were found. To create one, choose one of the "
"following options:<list><item>Install Kleopatra and use it to create a new "
"key. See these <link url='https://docs.kde.org/stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/"
"kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>instructions</link>.</item><item>Open a "
"terminal and enter <command>gpg --full-gen-key</command>.</item><item>Go "
"back and use Blowfish encryption instead, which only requires a password.</"
"item></list>"
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh aon eochair chriptithe GPG oiriúnach. Chun ceann a chruthú, roghnaigh ceann de na roghanna seo a leanas:<list><item>Suiteáil Kleopatra agus úsáid é chun eochair nua a chruthú. Féach na <link url='https://docs.kde.org/stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>treoracha</link> seo.</item><item>Oscail teirminéal agus iontráil <command>gpg --full-gen-key</command>.</item><item>Téigh siar agus úsáid criptiú Blowfish ina ionad, nach dteastaíonn uaidh ach focal faire.</item></list>"

